        <profile name="Whip of God" id="3334-ac1d-eda1-a0e1" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Unlike other models, a Castigator is allowed to attack friendly models with melee attacks within 1”. They can do this without declaring a charge. Each time the Castigator takes a friendly model Out of Action with a melee attack, set a die aside in a pool as the act of piety inspires the troops. The next time your warband makes a Morale roll, add an amount of +DICE to that roll equal to the amount of dice in the pool and empty it.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Enforced Orthodoxy" id="9a0d-9964-aee2-78c4" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">At any point during its Activation, a Castigator may take a RISKY ACTION with +1 DICE. If successful, all friendly models that are Down and within 8” of the Castigator may immediately stand up at no penalty or cost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
