          <profiles>
            <profile name=" Awaited" id="8cbd-7395-617e-ef28" hidden="false" typeId="7079-589c-df69-fa7e" typeName="Battlekit">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="3f15-74a1-4d35-3642"/>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77"/>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496"/>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">If the Ecclesiastic Prisoner is taken Out of Action by its Martyrdom Device, it does not count as being Out of Action for any rules related to Morale.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Martyrdom Device" id="4283-0424-9334-02b2" hidden="false" typeId="7079-589c-df69-fa7e" typeName="Battlekit">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="3f15-74a1-4d35-3642"/>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77"/>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496"/>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">An Ecclesiastic Prisoner with a Martyrdom Device can take a Trigger Martyrdom Device ACTION. If they do so, the Martyrdom Device detonates and cannot be used again. When Martyrdom Device detonates, make an Injury Roll for all models within 3&quot; of the Ecclesiastic Prisoner (friend or foe, including the Ecclesiastic Prisoner). Make the Injury Roll for the Ecclesiastic Prisoner by rolling 4D6 and adding all 4 dice together, and add +1 INJURY DICE to the Injury Rolls for other models that are within 1&quot; of the Ecclesiastic Prisoner. If an Ecclesiastic Prisoner detonates their Martyrdom Device and survives the game, you must either buy them a new Martyrdom Device for 35 ducats, or use them without one.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Stigmatic Nun" id="caa2-22ce-1bc5-4d51" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
