              <conditions>
                <condition childId="65bd-e9b5-eea8-5f65" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Blood Eagle Banner" id="55e3-793d-4961-e12f" hidden="false" typeId="7079-589c-df69-fa7e" typeName="Battlekit">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="3f15-74a1-4d35-3642">Equipment</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496">HELD</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Before the start of the battle, you may choose to either Punish the Villutrúarmaður or Offer unto the Gods.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Punish the Villutrúarmaður" id="2308-4f6a-4c7b-16a4" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">A still-living prisoner of the opposing faction is hung upon the Banner. When an enemy declares a Charge ACTION, an enemy model must choose a model that has Blood Eagle Banner as the target of the charge if the model is in its Line of Sight, not already within 1” of an enemy model, and can be reached without the charging model having to Climb, Jump, make a Diving Charge, or move across Dangerous terrain.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Offer unto the Gods" id="b0f7-9667-9aa4-29d7" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">You may choose to hang another member of your warband at the Banner. The model you choose is permanently removed from your Warband, but you can redistribute their Battlekit to other models that would be allowed to have it. For the duration of the battle, your warband gains +1 DICE for all Morale tests as long as the model with the flag is not Down or Out of Action.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
