                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496"/>
                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">A Stormbreaker Shield is a Trench Shield (Nordic). In addition, add -1 INJURY DICE to rolls for Ranged Attacks that hit the model.</characteristic>
