                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="87f0-637b-734a-22eb">Full Auto: Each time you take a Shoot ACTION with an Autocannon, you must choose to either fire it using the Bursts Weapon Profile or the Full Auto Weapons Profile.</characteristic>
