                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Cower Before The Lord: An enemy model that does not have the FEAR keyword and that starts an Activation within 1&quot; of this Anchorite Shrine must take a Retreat ACTION as part of the Activation. It cannot take any ACTION that require a Risky Success Roll while it is within 1&quot; of this Anchorite Shrine.</characteristic>
